<title>YUGOSLAVIA: YUGOSLAVIA COPPER OUTPUT UP SLIGHTLY IN MAY.</title>
<headline>YUGOSLAVIA COPPER OUTPUT UP SLIGHTLY IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV NON-FERROUS ORES	 MAY	APRIL	MAY 96</p>
<p> copper (thousand tonnes)	1,831	1,811	 1,738</p>
<p> lead-zinc			     122	   78	    73</p>
<p> bauxite				  41	   10	    27</p>
<p>NON-FERROUS METAL PRODUCTION</p>
<p> electrolytic copper (tonnes) 11,010	9,379	10,759</p>
<p> refined lead			1,776	1,847	 3,235</p>
<p> zinc				  1,035	2,320	 1,890</p>
<p> aluminium ingots		  5,353	6,306	 2,967</p>
<p> refined silver (kilos)	  3,033	3,949	 5,950</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 311 4305</p>
